  "segments": [
   {
    "id": "t1",
    "start": 0.56,
    "end": 4.08,
    "text": "There are some anxiety lowering herbs they don't want you to know about."
   },
   {
    "id": "t2",
    "start": 4.08,
    "end": 9.08,
    "text": "So if you are suffering with anxiety, nervousness, panic attacks, there really is no need to"
   },
   {
    "id": "t3",
    "start": 9.08,
    "end": 10.08,
    "text": "suffer."
   },
   {
    "id": "t4",
    "start": 10.08,
    "end": 11.24,
    "text": "I don't want you to suffer."
   },
   {
    "id": "t5",
    "start": 11.24,
    "end": 14.56,
    "text": "And I love these herbal medicines, especially in the proper combination."
   },
   {
    "id": "t6",
    "start": 14.56,
    "end": 19.92,
    "text": "They're fantastic at removing and decreasing what I call that hot wiring of your nervous"
   },
   {
    "id": "t7",
    "start": 19.92,
    "end": 20.92,
    "text": "system."
   },
   {
    "id": "t8",
    "start": 20.92,
    "end": 26.52,
    "text": "So they are valerian, skull cap, as well as lemon balm and passion flower."
   },
   {
    "id": "t9",
    "start": 26.52,
    "end": 31.28,
    "text": "herbal medicines are known in the literature to really help to decrease that nervousness"
   },
   {
    "id": "t10",
    "start": 31.28,
    "end": 36.36,
    "text": "and anxiety without negative side effects, which often goes hand in hand with a lot of"
   },
   {
    "id": "t11",
    "start": 36.36,
    "end": 38.92,
    "text": "the pharmaceutical ways to help with anxiety."
   },
   {
    "id": "t12",
    "start": 38.92,
    "end": 40.28,
    "text": "So you're going to love these."
   },
   {
    "id": "t13",
    "start": 40.28,
    "end": 41.6,
    "text": "Follow for more natural health tips."
   }
  ]
 },
